  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PalMEL - Independent Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (Contract)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PalMEL programme aims to provide a wide range of monitoring, research and analysis services in support of BCGJ&#x2019;s Country Business Plan. Primarily, it will provide assurance that expected results are being achieved and delivery standards are met. PalMEL&#x2019;s outputs will improve delivery and inform strategic decisions across our diplomatic and development activities, as well as improve accountability and value for money (VfM). It will support our partners and the wider system to deliver coordinated impact for Palestinians.</narrative>
  </description>
